WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.177 --> 00:00:02.872
We’re building Sunday Rooftop Sessions

2
00:00:02.976 --> 00:00:04.912
a weekly Lagos night.

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.075
Start at Harmattan Club.

4
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:09.974
Tap plus,

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:11.855
Create event,

6
00:00:12.992 --> 00:00:14.269
then Ticketed event.

7
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.789
Keep it in person and choose Club Night.

8
00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:20.293
Add Social, Vibrant

9
00:00:20.293 --> 00:00:21.584
and Laid-back,

10
00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:24.315
with Afrobeats, Afro House

11
00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:25.842
and Amapiano.

12
00:00:26.436 --> 00:00:27.859
Close the keyboard,

13
00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:30.668
then review the full rooftop description.

14
00:00:32.713 --> 00:00:33.824
Step two:

15
00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:36.415
choose Sunday the eighteenth of October,

16
00:00:36.415 --> 00:00:38.999
from seven until eleven at night.

17
00:00:39.428 --> 00:00:41.674
Set it to repeat every Sunday,

18
00:00:41.869 --> 00:00:43.682
keep eight occurrences,

19
00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:46.706
and use Africa/Lagos time.

20
00:00:52.673 --> 00:00:53.549
Step three:

21
00:00:53.861 --> 00:00:56.237
choose Harmattan Club and its address.

22
00:01:01.366 --> 00:01:02.880
Leave Hide address on,

23
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.940
so guests only see the full location

24
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.481
after getting tickets.

25
00:01:07.947 --> 00:01:09.099
Step four:

26
00:01:09.455 --> 00:01:10.931
add a static cover

27
00:01:10.931 --> 00:01:12.866
and three gallery photos.

28
00:01:13.254 --> 00:01:15.524
Use the warm orange theme,

29
00:01:15.524 --> 00:01:17.984
Poppins, and the Shimmer reveal.

30
00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.543
Step five:

31
00:01:24.749 --> 00:01:28.133
create Rooftop Pass at one hundred naira,

32
00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.287
with sixty tickets per night.

33
00:01:30.694 --> 00:01:32.763
Sell online and at the door,

34
00:01:32.852 --> 00:01:34.393
enable the waitlist,

35
00:01:34.426 --> 00:01:36.517
limit each buyer to four,

36
00:01:36.709 --> 00:01:38.362
and allow transfers.

37
00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.787
In Settings,

38
00:01:46.809 --> 00:01:48.009
keep it Public.

39
00:01:48.371 --> 00:01:49.923
Leave approval off,

40
00:01:49.946 --> 00:01:52.983
transfers and in-person payments on,

41
00:01:53.065 --> 00:01:55.062
and hide the remaining count.

42
00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.308
Preview the guest page.

43
00:01:59.592 --> 00:02:01.021
When everything checks out,

44
00:02:01.021 --> 00:02:02.957
publish the recurring event.

45
00:02:03.461 --> 00:02:05.929
Mingla confirms that all eight

46
00:02:05.929 --> 00:02:07.617
occurrences will be created.

47
00:02:12.053 --> 00:02:12.850
Now it’s live.

48
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.747
Guests can choose from eight Sundays.

49
00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.287
The Rooftop Pass is one hundred naira.

50
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.967
The full description is clear.

51
00:02:32.277 --> 00:02:34.237
And the address stays private

52
00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:35.117
until they get tickets.
